{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_toddi_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_toddi_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "装甲与重弩",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_toddi_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "df16cdb8fc38d7de9825223e97399bede19d12bb0ce4b66798ff0b0fde24eb71",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，斐迪亚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我和暴躁铁皮已经在向左移动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的意思是，破城矢的落点在左边——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你挡我炮位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斐迪亚，还活着吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "说真的，我从没打过这么难受的架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这个大家伙还蛮结实的嘛。嗯，应该只是被爆炸波及了，看起来没什么大损伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许破城矢的装药量可以再提高两成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "那我绝对不会再和你出任务了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯......三号关节的液压系统不太稳定，这笔维修费你帮我出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不能怪我，你的机甲真的很影响视野，也真的很适合被攻城弩来一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有机会真得试试，应该打得穿吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......赌上提亚卡乌的名誉，下次你部门内的武器预算申请，我一定投反对票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "开什么玩笑，你懂不懂攻城武器的重要性？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "师父说了，罗德岛不会装备任何攻城武器。这不符合我们的中立原则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "不过，你这个大弓箭，也算不得攻城武器就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什......？！便携攻城弩也是攻城弩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "这弓箭连引擎都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弓箭本来就没有引擎！还有我这个是弩炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我部落里的弓箭就是有引擎的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......想打架吗，斐迪亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我叫祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，当我们不存在吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉＆森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闭嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就看看你这堆废铜烂铁，到底能不能扛住一发破城矢吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "乐意奉陪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个......打扰一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嫌命长吗？我们这里忙着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二位就是罗德岛吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "您是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，顺便提醒你们一下，那架弩炮的右侧扭力系统应该是在刚刚的战斗中磨损了，继续使用的话会对精确度有点影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那边的......呃......黄色拖拉机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你可以叫她暴躁铁皮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最好看看冷却系统的状况，再拖下去引擎会有异响的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......真的！谢谢你，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荒地人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以叫我老乔，初次见面，罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是这次任务的委托人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们的行动编组......只有两个人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不信任我们的专业能力吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么会，你们可是慑砂推荐的。罗德岛的名字......在荒地人中也不算陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，再怎么说，两个人也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "哈哈......的确是出了一些意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再行驶一个小时左右就抵达情报所描述的废弃地块的位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熔泉，森蚺，装备检查得怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "呼，刚刚装完车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "暴躁铁皮状态良好，之前和师父做了一次全面升级，现在驾驶位坐起来舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，这次行动的确没看到那只奇怪的黎博利......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "大祭司爷爷说不能总靠他来驾驶，这毕竟是我的机甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你来开我反倒更放心一点......熔泉，攻城弩状态正常吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我说，听博士说有个废弃地块可以打，我才来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "结果，居然是个营救任务？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......现在才反应过来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈——我可是为了这次任务，熬了三个大夜，特别赶制了一批超重型破城矢！结果居然是营救在废弃地块里的荒地人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "熔泉......下次行动前好好看看任务简报呗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为有敌人已经占领地块并凭借工事反击的可能，我才向博士申请指派你们几个有攻坚能力的干员来的，以防万一嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "就算面对的是废弃地块，可那毕竟曾经是移动城市的一部分，准备好重武器总是没错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，早知道去逛街了，没劲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说这批荒地人跟着移动城市迁徙了很久了，好不容易等到有地块报废，本来想趁机过几天舒服日子，也能从废弃地块里找些补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "结果，这里的帕夏和“约翰老妈”早就签了一份回收合同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，他们做生意的方式一向是比较直接的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们在前面的坎宁路口集合，从西南方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打断一下，煌大姐，你有没有觉得能见度有点低？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "风声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前方天气有异常！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我们这辆车也看到尘云了！"
    },
    {
