      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出示一下合同看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嘿，你看，我们并不是荒野暴徒，我们是资源回收从业者，是资源，就有价值，就值得被利用，比如这里的零件和废铁。"
