      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“回收利用是文明的本质”，这是我们公司的口号，贴在办公室墙上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是你坦率地告诉我，你信奉谁拳头大谁厉害，我还能高看你一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁让你说话了！现在是我在教育你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
