      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给我听好了，你管一场屠戮叫“文明”？你管切断喉管叫“回收”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这娘们！明明是个炮手，为什么——呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那老头抱着包逃命，你们追逐他取乐，那女人想救她的孩子，你们扯着她的头发拖开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们不过是一帮碰巧拿上了刀枪的懦夫，想找些老弱病残逞逞威风罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别小看我——"
