      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这些杂鱼？啧，心情不爽，活动活动好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该死，碰上硬点子了！撤，撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "哇，我好不容易才找到路欸，这就结束了？再陪我玩玩嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沙蜥帮队长",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噫——快走，跑啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "都结束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，跑了一部分。不过，他们说的帕夏和约翰老妈的协议......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "约翰老妈不会承认的。不过这帮荒地人也得尽快转移，有几个感染者的病情不太乐观啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "熔泉，刚才还挺险的，还好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你干嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，这攻城弩的弦轴稳定器被切掉了，大概是拖拉机入场的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一拳，你给我老实受着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你之前也打坏了我的液压系统啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一码归一码！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用管吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......熔泉小姐，我手上的材料就只能修到这个程度了，调校可能还需要你自己来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "森蚺小姐，引擎的状况还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "谢谢你的零件，整修得差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煌小姐还有些收尾工作需要完成，她说她会直接在本舰与二位会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在这种气氛，我真的很尴尬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你们那些荒地人，真的不去附近的罗德岛医疗点吗？他们有的人病得很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是我们的生活方式，尘归尘，土归土，既然来到了荒野，那归于荒野就是注定的结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死在矿石病手里，和死在土匪手里没什么区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "你们就没有向往过......移动城市上的文明吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈，文明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们这些荒地人，本身就是被它抛下的人，回不去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "看你的工匠手艺，你究竟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别问，别打探荒地人以前的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个聚落帮过我一次，我按规矩回报他们一次，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "翻过前面两个沙丘，就到本舰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也该告辞了，谢谢你们搭我一程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，红发姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_008",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "身手不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是啊，回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "登上罗德岛不会有感觉，但从这个角度看过去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......真是奇迹啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "我在萨尔贡的丛林中长大，从未接触过什么机械之类的东西。大家用拳头也能生活得很好。有一天，我偶然看见一座移动城市驶过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "在那个清晨，那个灰蒙蒙的影子，遥远的轰鸣，我一辈子也不会忘，那是文明和进步的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "而我们，现在竟然就在其中一座上生活着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗德岛不是移动城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "移动城市里也没有会说话的机器啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，祖玛玛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说，我如果在这个距离开一炮，重型破城矢能刺穿罗德岛的外层装甲吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "熔泉，如果你以后还想从师父那里拿经费的话，我建议你不要尝试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我出生在维多利亚，一个萨尔贡的瓦伊凡移民家庭，说起来我们算同乡。我妈妈偶尔还会做几道萨尔贡菜，似是而非吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "短蕉果烤鳞肉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没那么正宗，只是些红椒茶之类的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瓦伊凡在维多利亚立足并不容易，要不然去参军，要不然就想办法融入当地，我家办了个工厂，生产一些......滑轮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没什么技术含量，弄些废铁，回炉重铸，保持好温度，最后浇成圆的，谁都能干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到，我祖父买来了一台机床。不知道他从哪倒腾来的旧型号二手货，巨大，笨重，用了不知道多少年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能想象它第一次启动的样子吗？当然惨不忍睹，可是，那巨大的噪声和震颤，那些陈旧的机械结构打开......我听不到自己的心跳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "比打架爽快，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一点没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你刚才说文明与进步......我们从不管机床叫“文明”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它只是能让我们活得更好一点罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "所以，这就是你们这次的外勤任务？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "不错嘛！听起来还挺刺激的！那个红头发的瓦伊凡，是叫熔泉来着？听起来是个拳头硬的好汉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "感觉你交到了个新朋友啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "哇，谁啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖玛玛，我的攻城弩MK30调试好了，来训练场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "你就是熔泉吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熔泉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_363_toddi_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，嘉维尔，我来约森蚺打架。"
    },
    {
